              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lazysue"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I doubled the recipe and used a 9 x 13 pan. For the icing, I melted 2 T peanut butter with 1cup of chocolate chips. My whole family loved them.",
            "datePublished": "2018-08-15T02:25:56.010Z"
